{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01628","headline":"杂曲歌辞 悲哉行 · 鲍溶","name":"杂曲歌辞 悲哉行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"促促晨复昏，死生同一源。\n贵年不惧老，贱老伤久存。\n朗朗哭前歌，绦旌引幽魂。\n来爲千金子，去卧百草根。\n黄土塞生路，悲风送回辕。\n金鞍旧良马，四顾不出门。\n生结千岁念，荣及百代孙。\n黄金买性命，白刃讐一言。\n宁知北山上，松柏侵田园。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01628.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01628","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}